const n='---\ntitle: "Qingpu Listing Products"\ndescription: "Product library and workspace picker APIs for the Qingpu listing workbench"\n---\n\n# Qingpu Listing Products API\n\nThis module documents the Qingpu listing product-library endpoints used by the workspace picker and product source list.\n\n## 1. List Products\n\n- **Endpoint**: `/api/qingpu/listing/products?page=1&limit=50&search=`\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **Authentication**: Required (User Session or Bearer tenant key)\n\n### Query Parameters\n\n| Name | Type | Required | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `page` | `number` | No | 1-based page index. Defaults to `1`. |\n| `limit` | `number` | No | Page size. Defaults to `20`, max `100`. |\n| `search` | `string` | No | Matches product title or source product id. |\n| `workspaceOnly` | `boolean` | No | When `true`, only returns products that already have workspace rows. |\n| `showDeleted` | `boolean` | No | When `true`, also returns soft-deleted products. When used with `workspaceOnly=true`, the response also exposes `workspaceSoftDeleted`. |\n\n### Success Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "data": {\n    "items": [\n      {\n        "productId": "p_123",\n        "sourcePlatform": "1688",\n        "sourceUrl": "https://detail.1688.com/offer/123.html",\n        "sourceProductId": "123",\n        "title": "Storage Box",\n        "mainImageUrl": "https://example.com/image.png",\n        "skuCount": 3,\n        "categoryId": 1001,\n        "categoryTypeId": 2001,\n        "categoryName": "Home / Storage",\n        "preprocessStatus": "generated",\n        "revision": 12,\n        "updatedAt": "2026-07-20T12:00:00.000Z",\n        "softDeleted": false,\n        "workspaceSoftDeleted": false\n      }\n    ],\n    "total": 1,\n    "softDeletedCount": 0,\n    "page": 1,\n    "limit": 50\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 2. Delete Products\n\n- **Endpoint**: `/api/qingpu/listing/products/delete`\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **Authentication**: Required (User Session or Bearer tenant key)\n\n### Request Body\n\n```json\n{\n  "productIds": ["p_123", "p_456"]\n}\n```\n\n### Success Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "data": {\n    "deletedCount": 2\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Notes\n\n- This updates `qingpu_listing_products.deleted_at` to the current timestamp.\n- The soft-delete cascades down to `workspaces`, `channel_drafts`, and `image_assets` so the whole resource tree stays hidden by default.\n\n## 3. Restore Products\n\n- **Endpoint**: `/api/qingpu/listing/products/restore`\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **Authentication**: Required (User Session or Bearer tenant key)\n\n### Request Body\n\n```json\n{\n  "productIds": ["p_123"]\n}\n```\n\n### Success Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "data": {\n    "restoredCount": 1\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Notes\n\n- This clears `qingpu_listing_products.deleted_at` back to `null`.\n- Workspaces, channel drafts, and image assets stay on their own restore flow, so downstream content that the user intentionally removed does not get pulled back automatically.\n\n## 4. Restore Workspace Row\n\n- **Endpoint**: `/api/qingpu/listing/workspaces/restore`\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **Authentication**: Required (User Session or Bearer tenant key)\n\n### Request Body\n\n```json\n{\n  "productId": "p_123"\n}\n```\n\n### Success Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "data": {\n    "restoredCount": 1\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Notes\n\n- This clears `qingpu_listing_workspaces.deleted_at` back to `null`.\n- The workspace picker can call this before navigating into an already soft-deleted workspace.\n\n## 5. Permanently Delete Products\n\n- **Endpoint**: `/api/qingpu/listing/products/purge`\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **Authentication**: Required (User Session or Bearer tenant key)\n\n### Request Body\n\n```json\n{\n  "productIds": ["p_123"]\n}\n```\n\n### Success Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "data": {\n    "deletedCount": 1\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Notes\n\n- This only works for products that are already soft-deleted.\n- The API physically removes the matching rows from `qingpu_listing_products`.\n- It also cascades the permanent deletion to `qingpu_listing_workspaces`, `qingpu_listing_channel_drafts`, and `qingpu_listing_image_assets` for the same `productId`.\n\n## 6. Permanently Delete Workspace Row\n\n- **Endpoint**: `/api/qingpu/listing/workspaces/purge`\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **Authentication**: Required (User Session or Bearer tenant key)\n\n### Request Body\n\n```json\n{\n  "productId": "p_123"\n}\n```\n\n### Success Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "data": {\n    "deletedCount": 1\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Notes\n\n- This only works when the workspace row is already soft-deleted.\n- The API physically removes the row from `qingpu_listing_workspaces`.\n- It does not delete the source product or channel drafts.\n';export{n as default};
